405	  /// this (before `close()`) when the *whole modal* is dismissed (✕/
406	  /// swipe-down/barrier tap), not just the tab. In that case there's no
407	  /// "switch back to the tab later" to preserve for — the cubit is about
408	  /// to be closed — so a preserved [PhotoRecognized]/[PhotoError]'s
