415	    // Bumped unconditionally — including when the state below doesn't
416	    // match — so an in-flight `_pick`/`_recognize`/`retry` continuation
417	    // still sees the mismatch and aborts itself even while still awaiting
418	    // (Review-finding rationale mirrored from `AudioEntryCubit.cancel()`).
419	    _generation++;
420	    // Review finding: without this, leaving the Foto tab while the
421	    // native picker call itself (not yet `PhotoProcessing`) was still in
422	    // flight left `_picking` stuck `true` forever — the `_generation`
423	    // bump above already makes that stale continuation a no-op, so
